IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cards-domain`
IMPORT `earn-kernel`
IMPORT `citi-exclusions`
IMPORT `citi-visa-wind-down`
IMPORT fixtures

§ `Citi Rewards Card — 10X Rewards Promotion Terms and Conditions`

-- ===========================================================================
-- DOCUMENT. citi-rewards-10x-tnc: "Citi Rewards Card – 10X Rewards Promotion
-- Terms and Conditions", cl.1-19, "Effective 1 April 2024" (Citibank Singapore
-- Limited). Guidance: citi-rewards-10x-faq (Q1-Q4, effective 1 April 2024),
-- which repeats cl.6, cl.5 and cl.13. Incorporated by reference: the Citi
-- exclusion list (citi-exclusions.l4). Superseded in part by the Citi Visa
-- discontinuation FAQ (citi-visa-wind-down.l4).
--
-- WHAT THE TEXT SAYS.
--   cl.3     "Eligible Card" = a Citi Rewards Visa Signature Card or a Citi
--            Rewards World Mastercard.
--   cl.5     A "Qualifying Charge" is a charge which does not arise from (i)
--            annual fees, interest, late payment charges, GST, cash advances,
--            instalment/easy/extended/equal payment plans, preferred payment
--            plans, balance transfers, quasi-cash, all fees; (ii) funds
--            transfers; (iii) bill payments "(including via Citibank Online or
--            via any other channel or agent)"; (iv) education; (v) government;
--            (vi) insurance; (vii) financial institutions; (viii) non-profit
--            organisations; (ix) betting; (x) top-ups or payment of funds to
--            payment service providers, prepaid cards and accounts; (xi)
--            "transit-related transactions"; (xii) an excluded Merchant Category
--            or merchant on the exclusion list.
--   cl.6     "10X Points Eligible Transaction" is (i) a Qualifying Charge "made at
--            any store that sells shoes and bags and clothes as its main business
--            activity, determined by the following Merchant Category Codes (MCC)"
--            (eleven MCCs), or (ii) "a Qualifying Charge made at an online retail
--            merchant, excluding mobile wallet and travel-related transactions".
--            Limb (ii) is "made via the internet or mobile applications, which is
--            determined by system indicators reflecting that it is an online
--            transaction ... These indicators are decided by the relevant
--            merchant and/or their acquirer and are not determined by Citibank."
--            Travel-related transactions "include but are not limited to"
--            fifteen MCC ranges.
--   cl.12    1 Base Point per S$1 of Qualifying Charges that are not 10X Points
--            Eligible Transactions, "rounded down to the nearest S$1" on each.
--   cl.13    1 Base Point and 9 Bonus Points per S$1 of a 10X Points Eligible
--            Transaction, rounded down to the nearest S$1 on each. "Base Points
--            are not subject to any cap. However, Bonus Points are subject to a
--            cap of 9,000 Bonus Points per statement month."
--   cl.18    A reversal reduces Bonus Points "only if cumulative value of new 10X
--            Points Eligible Transactions in the respective spend category is
--            higher than the value of transactions reversed/refunded."
--
-- THE LIMBS ARE NOT SYMMETRIC ABOUT WALLETS. The wallet exclusion ("excluding
-- mobile wallet") sits on limb (ii) only. Limb (i) turns on the MCC and says
-- nothing of how the card was presented, so a wallet tapped at a clothes store
-- (MCC 5651) is a 10X Points Eligible Transaction by limb (i). The same wallet
-- used inside an app or on a website at an online merchant that is not a clothes
-- store is excluded by limb (ii). This is the reading the text bears (fork
-- F-citi-wallet takes it as the answer; the other, that "mobile wallet" is
-- excluded everywhere, has no support in cl.6(i)).
--
-- THE FORKS.
--   F-citi-excl-ranges (in citi-exclusions.l4), F-bill-payments (cl.5(iii):
--     a bill paid directly on the card), F-citi-visa-date (the Visa's last day).
--   F-citi-travel: "include but are not limited to" fifteen ranges; a transaction
--     "wholly or partially related to any form of travel" is excluded from limb
--     (ii). The module excludes the listed ranges; a purchase at another MCC that
--     the cardholder knows to be travel-related is not modelled.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `cl.5 -- Qualifying Charge`

-- cl.5(i), (ii), (iii), (x), (xi) by kind of charge. A bill paid through a bank
-- or agent channel is a bill payment; one paid directly on the card is the open
-- reading (F-bill-payments).
GIVEN k IS A `Charge kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Citi 10X cl.5 excludes the kind` k MEANS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `Retail purchase`                                   THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Bill payment`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`      THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Top-up of a prepaid card or stored-value account`  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Payment of funds to a payment service provider`    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Instalment plan charge`                            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `My Preferred Payment Plan charge`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Cash advance`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Balance transfer or funds transfer`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Fee, interest or finance charge`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Pre-authorisation`                                 THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Payment through UOB Payment Facility`              THEN FALSE
    WHEN `NETS or NETS-related transaction`                  THEN FALSE
    WHEN `SmartPay or personal loan`                         THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Transit-related transaction`                       THEN TRUE

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the Citi 10X purchase is not a Qualifying Charge` p MEANS
    `Citi 10X cl.5 excludes the kind` (p's `charge kind`)
    OR `the Citi exclusion list excludes` p
    OR p's `later reversed`


§§ `cl.6 -- 10X Points Eligible Transactions`

-- cl.6(i): the eleven MCCs: 5311, 5611, 5621, 5631, 5641, 5651, 5655, 5661,
-- 5691, 5699, 5948.
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`the Citi 10X shoes bags and clothes codes` MEANS
    LIST 5311, 5611, 5621, 5631, 5641, 5651, 5655, 5661, 5691, 5699, 5948

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the Citi 10X purchase is at a shoes bags and clothes MCC` p MEANS
    `the code is among` p `the Citi 10X shoes bags and clothes codes`

-- cl.6(ii) footnote: the listed travel-related MCCs: 3000-3350, 3351-3500,
-- 3501-3999, 4111, 4112, 4789, 4411, 4511, 4722, 4723, 5962, 7011, 7012, 7512.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the Citi 10X purchase is at a listed travel MCC` p MEANS
    `the code is from` p 3000 3999
    OR `the code is among` p (LIST 4111, 4112, 4789, 4411, 4511, 4722, 4723, 5962, 7011, 7012, 7512)

-- cl.6(ii): "made via the internet or mobile applications". The wallet is
-- excluded: a wallet used in an app or on a website is "mobile wallet".
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the Citi 10X purchase was made via the internet or an app without the wallet` p MEANS
    p's presentation EQUALS `Card number entered online`
    OR p's presentation EQUALS `Card details held on file by the merchant`
    OR p's presentation EQUALS `Recurring payment arrangement`

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the Citi 10X purchase was paid with the wallet in an app or on a website` p MEANS
    p's presentation EQUALS `Wallet used in an app or on a website`

-- Limb (ii), indicator settled: online, not by wallet, not travel-related.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`limb (ii) holds for` p MEANS
    `the Citi 10X purchase was made via the internet or an app without the wallet` p
    AND p's `merchant indicator` EQUALS `Flags online`
    AND NOT (`the Citi 10X purchase is at a listed travel MCC` p)


§§ `cl.12, cl.13 -- the points`

GIVETH A NUMBER
`Citi Bonus Points per S$1 of a 10X Points Eligible Transaction` MEANS 9

GIVETH A NUMBER
`Citi Bonus Points cap per statement month` MEANS 9000

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the whole S$1 in` amount MEANS
    FLOOR amount

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Citi month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Citi Bonus Points on` p `in the month` m MEANS
    min ((`Citi Bonus Points per S$1 of a 10X Points Eligible Transaction`) TIMES (`the whole S$1 in` (p's `amount in SGD`)))
        (`at least nothing` ((`Citi Bonus Points cap per statement month`) MINUS (m's `Bonus Points earned`)))

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Citi month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Citi 10X answer on a 10X Points Eligible Transaction` c p m MEANS
    `an answer for` c `in` `Citi ThankYou Points` `of` ((`the whole S$1 in` (p's `amount in SGD`)) PLUS (`the Citi Bonus Points on` p `in the month` m)) `to` ((`the whole S$1 in` (p's `amount in SGD`)) PLUS (`the Citi Bonus Points on` p `in the month` m)) `wanting` ((`Citi Bonus Points per S$1 of a 10X Points Eligible Transaction`) TIMES (`the whole S$1 in` (p's `amount in SGD`))) `at` NOTHING `excluded` FALSE `drawing on` `Citi 10X bonus` `depending on` EMPTY `per` "Citi 10X T&C cl.6, cl.13"

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Citi 10X answer on a Qualifying Charge` c p MEANS
    `an answer for` c `in` `Citi ThankYou Points` `of` (`the whole S$1 in` (p's `amount in SGD`)) `to` (`the whole S$1 in` (p's `amount in SGD`)) `wanting` 0 `at` NOTHING `excluded` FALSE `drawing on` `No pot` `depending on` EMPTY `per` "Citi 10X T&C cl.12"

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Citi month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Citi 10X answer when the code and indicator are settled` c p m MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the Citi 10X purchase is not a Qualifying Charge` p
            THEN `nothing is earned on` c `in` `Citi ThankYou Points` `per` "Citi 10X T&C cl.5 and the Citi exclusion list"
        IF `the Citi 10X purchase is at a shoes bags and clothes MCC` p OR `limb (ii) holds for` p
            THEN `Citi 10X answer on a 10X Points Eligible Transaction` c p m
        OTHERWISE `Citi 10X answer on a Qualifying Charge` c p

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Citi month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Citi 10X answer when the indicator flags card-present` c p m MEANS
    `Citi 10X answer when the code and indicator are settled` c (`reflagged purchase` p `Flags card-present`) m

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Citi month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Citi 10X answer when the indicator flags online` c p m MEANS
    `Citi 10X answer when the code and indicator are settled` c (`reflagged purchase` p `Flags online`) m

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Citi month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Citi 10X answer when the code is settled` c p m MEANS
    IF `the Citi 10X purchase was made via the internet or an app without the wallet` p AND p's `merchant indicator` EQUALS `Indicator not known`
    THEN `bracketed from` (`Citi 10X answer when the indicator flags card-present` c p m) `to` (`Citi 10X answer when the indicator flags online` c p m) `adding` (LIST `The merchant's indicator is not known`)
    ELSE `Citi 10X answer when the code and indicator are settled` c p m

GIVEN c IS A Card
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Citi 10X earns nothing under the open reading` c MEANS
    `nothing is earned on` c `in` `Citi ThankYou Points` `per` "Citi 10X T&C cl.5(iii) and the exclusion list (open reading)"

`a Citi code that is excluded` MEANS 6529
`a Citi code that is online and not travel` MEANS 5999

-- The Visa's last day (F-citi-visa-date): a Citi Visa posted on or after the
-- reported date has a floor of nothing and a ceiling of the ordinary earn.
GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Citi month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Citi 10X answer after the open questions about the code` c p m MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the code is unknown for` p
            THEN `bracketed from` (`Citi 10X answer when the code is settled` c (`recoded purchase` p `a Citi code that is excluded`) m) `to` (`Citi 10X answer when the code is settled` c (`recoded purchase` p `a Citi code that is online and not travel`) m) `adding` (LIST `The merchant category code is not known`)
        IF `only the Citi ranges would exclude` p
            THEN `bracketed from` (`Citi 10X earns nothing under the open reading` c) `to` (`Citi 10X answer when the code is settled` c p m) `adding` (LIST `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)`)
        IF p's `charge kind` EQUALS `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`
            THEN `bracketed from` (`Citi 10X earns nothing under the open reading` c) `to` (`Citi 10X answer when the code is settled` c p m) `adding` (LIST `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)`)
        OTHERWISE `Citi 10X answer when the code is settled` c p m

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Citi month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Citi Rewards earns on` c p m MEANS
    IF `the reported date decides whether` c `posted on` (p's `date posted`) `earns`
    THEN `bracketed from` (`Citi 10X earns nothing under the open reading` c) `to` (`Citi 10X answer after the open questions about the code` c p m) `adding` (LIST `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)`)
    ELSE `Citi 10X answer after the open questions about the code` c p m


§§ `The clock the Citi 10X bonus pot runs on`

-- cl.13 ("per statement month").
GIVETH A `Period basis`
`the Citi 10X bonus pot's period` MEANS `Statement period`

GIVETH A `Date basis`
`the Citi 10X bonus pot's date basis` MEANS `Not stated in the document`

#ASSERT `the Citi 10X bonus pot's period` EQUALS `Statement period`
#ASSERT `the Citi 10X bonus pot's date basis` EQUALS `Not stated in the document`


§§ `Illustrations`

GIVEN soFar IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Citi month`
`a Citi month with Bonus Points of` soFar MEANS
    `Citi month` WITH `Bonus Points earned` IS soFar

`a fresh Citi month` MEANS `a Citi month with Bonus Points of` 0
`the Citi Mastercard` MEANS `Citi Rewards World Mastercard`
`the Citi Visa` MEANS `Citi Rewards Visa Signature`

`S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` MEANS `recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5651
`S$100 in store at a clothes shop by Apple Pay` MEANS `purchase paid by` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` `Wallet tapped on a reader`
`S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, flagged online` MEANS `reflagged purchase` (`purchase paid by` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5262) `Card number entered online`) `Flags online`
`S$100 online with Apple Pay at a marketplace, flagged online` MEANS `purchase paid by` `S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, flagged online` `Wallet used in an app or on a website`
`S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, indicator not known` MEANS `reflagged purchase` `S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, flagged online` `Indicator not known`
`S$100 online with the card number at an airline` MEANS `recoded purchase` `S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, flagged online` 3001
`S$100 online with the card number at a charging app, flagged online` MEANS `recoded purchase` `S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, flagged online` 5552

-- cl.13: 1 Base + 9 Bonus per S$1: S$100 earns 1,000 ThankYou Points.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 1000
-- cl.6(i): a wallet tapped at a clothes store is still limb (i): no wallet language.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by Apple Pay` `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 1000
-- cl.6(ii): online, card number, flagged online: 1,000.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, flagged online` `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 1000
-- ... the same with Apple Pay: "excluding mobile wallet": the Base only, 100.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$100 online with Apple Pay at a marketplace, flagged online` `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 100
-- ... indicator not known: floor 100, ceiling 1,000.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, indicator not known` `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 100
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, indicator not known` `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT elem `The merchant's indicator is not known` ((`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, indicator not known` `a fresh Citi month`)'s `depends on`)
-- ... travel-related online (an airline, 3001): the Base only.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$100 online with the card number at an airline` `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 100
-- ... EV charging (5552) online by card number, flagged online: not travel, so 10X.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$100 online with the card number at a charging app, flagged online` `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 1000
-- ... card-present, physical card at a non-listed MCC (a restaurant 5812): Base only.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `the base purchase` `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 100

-- cl.13, the worked example: S$800.99 at a department store (800 base + 7,200 bonus) and S$550.24 at a shoe store
-- (550 base + 4,950 bonus): bonus 12,150 capped at 9,000; total 10,350.
`S$800.99 at a department store` MEANS `purchase for` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5311) 800.99
`S$550.24 at a shoe store` MEANS `purchase for` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5661) 550.24
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$800.99 at a department store` `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 8000
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$550.24 at a shoe store` (`a Citi month with Bonus Points of` 7200))'s `units certain` EQUALS 2350
-- (550 base + the 1,800 of bonus room left = 2,350; the bonus before the cap is 4,950.)
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$550.24 at a shoe store` (`a Citi month with Bonus Points of` 7200))'s `bonus units before cap` EQUALS 4950

-- cl.13: the cap is 9,000 Bonus Points per statement month; with it spent only the Base remains.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` (`a Citi month with Bonus Points of` 9000))'s `units certain` EQUALS 100
-- cl.12/13: rounded down per transaction to S$1: S$99.99 -> 99 Base + 891 Bonus = 990.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`purchase for` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` 99.99) `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 990

-- cl.5: nothing on a bill payment through a channel, an instalment plan, a transit charge, a listed MCC or description.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` `Bill payment`) `a fresh Citi month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` `Instalment plan charge`) `a fresh Citi month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` `Transit-related transaction`) `a fresh Citi month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`recoded purchase` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` 9311) `a fresh Citi month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`purchase described as` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` `SimplyGo as a descriptor`) `a fresh Citi month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`purchase later reversed` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card`) `a fresh Citi month`)'s excluded
-- A bill paid directly on the card (a StarHub bill in the app): the open reading, floor 0.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, flagged online` `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`) `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, flagged online` `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`) `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 1000

-- Both networks earn alike before the Visa's last day: posted 7 October 2026.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Visa` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 1000
-- ... the Visa posted on 20 October 2026: floor 0, ceiling 1,000, the reported date open.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Visa` (`purchase posted on` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` (Date 20 10 2026)) `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Visa` (`purchase posted on` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` (Date 20 10 2026)) `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 1000
-- ... the Mastercard is unaffected.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`purchase posted on` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` (Date 20 10 2026)) `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 1000

-- The code not known: floor 0, ceiling the online 10X.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`purchase with unknown code` `S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, flagged online`) `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`purchase with unknown code` `S$100 online with the card number at a marketplace, flagged online`) `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 1000
-- A code inside a range the exclusion list names but does not print: the open reading.
#ASSERT (`Citi Rewards earns on` `the Citi Mastercard` (`recoded purchase` `S$100 in store at a clothes shop by physical card` 8250) `a fresh Citi month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 0
